# Optional. Everything has a safe default; the lab needs no tenant, no gateway and no credentials (it holds none).
# The shared settings file is ~/Development/.env (mode 600; STANDALONE_ENV overrides the path), read by every standalone app.
# There is no per-app .env file. This lab reads one optional key from the shared file:
# ROUTE_LAB_MODE=mock             # the mode the page opens in. mock is the default; live is refused for now (the page stays in Mock and says why)
# Per-run settings (shell, not the shared file; the shared file holds no PORT):
# PORT=5050                       # must be in 5050-5099
# LAB_BIND=127.0.0.1              # loopback only unless you set this on purpose (the container does)
